                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "c764a9ef-2501-3970-bce8-88d052d47a2d",
                        "entry_id": "6bc95177-960f-3c58-a672-57caad475742",
                        "glosses": [
                            "parfum, geurtje"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "17f109eb-10ee-4f1d-98c9-4c778b0a6c71",
                                "sense_id": "c764a9ef-2501-3970-bce8-88d052d47a2d",
                                "text": "In de jaren 90 was er al een kentering in de parfumwereld, toen er met CK One een uniseks parfum op de markt kwam en met Odeur 53, ook van Comme des Garçons, een parfum met een benzineluchtje aan. Dat soort spielerei is nu de gewoonste zaak van de wereld, reden waarom de grote merken nog een stapje verder gaan. Ze doen alles om aan de grillen van de millennials tegemoet te komen. Geen van die parfums zijn genderspecifiek, ze dienen vooral om de aandacht te trekken - of om mensen hun neus te doen optrekken. Ze zijn met andere woorden even individualistisch als hun doelpubliek. De nieuwe generatie parfumkopers wil zichzelf op alle mogelijke manieren een eigen identiteit aanmeten, en een eigen geur hoort daarbij. Dat is veel belangrijker dan fris ruiken, of ruiken alsof je gisteravond van de grond bent gegaan."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "98236ebb-8814-45c9-9366-ccd5ea1712a0",
                        "source_entry_id": "6bc95177-960f-3c58-a672-57caad475742",
                        "source_sense_id": "c764a9ef-2501-3970-bce8-88d052d47a2d",
                        "source_sense_description": "parfum, geurtje",
                        "target_lang_word": "perfume",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "perfume",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "72416554-1a1a-3095-a402-39291d3f9d6d",
                                        "entry_id": "1ed4ae26-b51b-35c5-8b8a-bc30d3422a87",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A pleasant smell; the scent, odor, or odoriferous particles emitted from a sweet-smelling substance; a pleasant odor."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "91c265ce-6360-4b9c-b15a-8b5aba38e05b",
                                                "sense_id": "72416554-1a1a-3095-a402-39291d3f9d6d",
                                                "text": "Breezes blowing from beds of iris quickened her breath with their perfume; she saw the tufted lilacs sway in the wind, and the streamers of mauve-tinted wistaria swinging, all a-glisten with golden bees; she saw a crimson cardinal winging through the foliage, and amorous tanagers flashing like scarlet flames athwart the pines."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2f6ddc82-aa71-4483-93e5-ee22eea6aa25",
                                                "sense_id": "72416554-1a1a-3095-a402-39291d3f9d6d",
                                                "text": "Among the Turks, an exciting compound consists of olibanum, myrrh, camphor, musk, in pulverized form. The resultant perfume is said to affect the genitals."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "04d14be6-a602-37bb-a83a-3cff549590c1",
                                        "entry_id": "1ed4ae26-b51b-35c5-8b8a-bc30d3422a87",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A substance created to provide a pleasant smell or one which emits an agreeable odor."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7739ddb7-9436-406c-9e89-4a669f79d461",
                                                "sense_id": "04d14be6-a602-37bb-a83a-3cff549590c1",
                                                "text": "She bought a perfume at the airport."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e66f4839-5889-49b6-aaff-15bf840b7851",
                                                "sense_id": "04d14be6-a602-37bb-a83a-3cff549590c1",
                                                "text": "The market for prestige perfumes is pretty much restricted to what industry economists call “gotrocks ladies”—women in households with annual incomes over $40,000 and who are over forty but still young enough to have a sense of smell (Elizabeth Taylor, for instance)."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "eaf5910e-089e-4357-866a-ea40bc9c6b6f",
                                                "sense_id": "04d14be6-a602-37bb-a83a-3cff549590c1",
                                                "text": "The perfume industry is facing a major problem: maintaining constant levels of quality is crucial, but it is increasingly difficult to obtain a regular supply of all the necessary natural ingredients."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "perfume",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "eab109dd-7f4d-3f51-9cb0-153e7c7c8c23",
                                        "entry_id": "95144905-e44c-3a2c-a4d5-b0e16d1f7f33",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To apply perfume to; to fill or impregnate with a perfume; to scent."
                                        ],
